    TB_A_MODELS["model comparison on the same held-out set:<br/>base open-weight vs fine-tuned (stretch) vs<br/>claude-haiku-4-5 / claude-sonnet-5 / claude-opus-5"]
    TB_A_TABLE["ablation table, paired deltas vs reference:<br/>precision · false auto-posts · questions · cost / 1k<br/>if tiered does not win, RESULTS.md says so"]
  end

